{
  "_template": "chat-mockup",
  "_description": "Propulsar brand — 1:1 composed chat-conversation mockup. Implements the locked castellano/legibility hard rule (16-CONTEXT.md): a WhatsApp-style conversation is NEVER drawn by Flux (which cannot reliably render legible text) — it is composed here by Creatomate as real text elements inside a phone-style panel, alternating received/sent bubble styling, so the on-screen chat is always genuine, legible castellano. Derived from single.json's canvas/brand frame (same 1080x1080 canvas, background/darken-overlay/badge/headline treatment). Placeholders ({{HEADLINE}}, {{BADGE}}, {{CHAT_LINE_1}}..{{CHAT_LINE_4}}, {{BACKGROUND_URL}}) are substituted by the caller before POSTing this JSON as the `source` field — this file is never sent to Creatomate as-is. NOT wired into the n8n image_model router this phase (16-CONTEXT.md) — this is the validated composition asset for any future chat-mockup concept; automatic pipeline runs never produce Flux-drawn chat text because the GPT-4o prompt layer (Plan 16-03 Tasks 1-2) prohibits it outright.",
